{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "hooks/the-side-effects-of-a-hook-that-closes-its-room-are-not-stored",
  "title": "The task and the observation a BEFORE_BROADCAST hook gives an event whose room it closes are not stored: the event is refused as the closed room refuses it, with nothing of its hooks",
  "rules": [
    "§10.1 step 9a",
    "§10.1 step 15",
    "§5.1"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.1-055",
    "RK-5.1-007",
    "RK-5.1-008",
    "RK-5.1-011",
    "RK-5.1-012"
  ],
  "notes": "One process. The `closer` hook closes the room as `Hello` passes it, and allows it with the task `Follow up` and an observation. Read again after the hook, the closed room refuses `Hello` as step 6 would: nothing is stored, the hook's task and observation included, and ON_TASK_CREATED does not fire. Python: core/mixins/inbound_locked.py `_gate_commit` returns `_Refused` before any side effect is kept.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "closer",
        "trigger": "before_broadcast",
        "reactions": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Hello"
            },
            "do": [
              {
                "call": "close_room",
                "room_id": "$room"
              }
            ],
            "result": {
              "action": "allow",
              "tasks": [
                {
                  "title": "Follow up"
                }
              ],
              "observations": [
                {
                  "category": "closing",
                  "content": "closed"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "follow_up",
        "trigger": "on_task_created",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Hello"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": true,
          "reason": "room_closed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "room-1": []
    },
    "tasks": {
      "room-1": []
    },
    "observations": {
      "room-1": []
    },
    "hooks": {
      "follow_up": []
    }
  }
}
